@startuml runtime-login
title PacMan - Runtime: Log in with Google Sign-In

actor Player as player
participant "API Client" as apiclient
participant "Identity Provider" as idp

player -> apiclient: Request sign-in before submitting a score
apiclient -> idp: Redirect to Google sign-in (OAuth2/OIDC)
idp -> player: Ask for credentials and consent
player -> idp: Authenticate (HTTPS/OIDC)
idp --> apiclient: Return signed ID token
apiclient -> apiclient: Keep ID token for score submission
note over apiclient: The Game API verifies this token in the submit scenario.

@enduml
